{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_1","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":1,"start_sec":1.04,"end_sec":2.24,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"On ne viče, on je tih."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_2","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":2,"start_sec":4.24,"end_sec":6.08,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Idemo uzeti olovku i papir."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_3","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":3,"start_sec":12.24,"end_sec":14.32,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Pa pokušati malo razmisliti."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_4","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":4,"start_sec":16.08,"end_sec":20.88,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Danas je četvrtak, deseti ožujak 2005."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_5","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":5,"start_sec":21.28,"end_sec":21.36,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"godine."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_6","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":6,"start_sec":23.04,"end_sec":26.8,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Danas je dan takozvanih 40 mučenika."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_7","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":7,"start_sec":27.28,"end_sec":40,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Bilo je to 40 vojnika koji se nisu htjeli odreći kršćanske vjere pa ih je car natjerao da u bazenu se smrznu."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_8","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":8,"start_sec":43.84,"end_sec":51.6,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Stajali su cijelu noć u bazenu dok se nisu smrznuli i pomrli i zato se zovu ledeni sveci također."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_9","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":9,"start_sec":52.96,"end_sec":58.8,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"I kažu ljudi seljaci kakav je danas dan takav će biti i slijedećih četrdeset dana."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_10","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":10,"start_sec":64,"end_sec":65.68,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Na dan četrdeset mučenika."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_11","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":11,"start_sec":66.56,"end_sec":71.04,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Danas je ujedno od danas pa do uskrsa točno sedamnaest dana."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_12","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":12,"start_sec":73.36,"end_sec":83.6,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Stalno nam viču naši političari sedamnaestog ožujka treba Evropa prihvatiti da s njima pregovaramo itede da iziđemo iz Europe pa kako bi nas oni primili."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_13","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":13,"start_sec":84.24,"end_sec":85.76,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"A mi smo već davno u Europi."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_14","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":14,"start_sec":87.04,"end_sec":90,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Međutim za sedamnaest dana nama daleko važnije dolazi uskrs."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_15","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":15,"start_sec":90.24,"end_sec":102,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"I sad je pitanje a što bih ja mogao napraviti da mi ova korizma ne prođe uzalud i da ne plaćem poslije kako sam trebao zalijevati dušu da bi narasla a ono prošlo dragocjeno vrijeme a ja ništa."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_16","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":16,"start_sec":102.56,"end_sec":105.6,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Zato idemo ovako pokušati razmišljati na ovu temu."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_17","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":17,"start_sec":107.12,"end_sec":110.72,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Dušo moja zarez, dušo moja zarez."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_18","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":18,"start_sec":112.24,"end_sec":116.88,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Što želiš da učinim za tebe do uskrsa."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_19","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":19,"start_sec":117.28,"end_sec":119.92,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Što želiš da za tebe učinim do uskrsa?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_20","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":20,"start_sec":120.72,"end_sec":123.28,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Upitnik pa tri točke, dušo moja."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_21","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":21,"start_sec":124.08,"end_sec":126.56,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Što želiš da za tebe učinim do uskrsa?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_22","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":22,"start_sec":126.72,"end_sec":128.08,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Upitnik tri točke."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_23","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":23,"start_sec":128.32,"end_sec":149.92,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Evo vam tri četiri minute vremena da se polako sjetite da treba često puta slušati u sebi svoju dušu, odsluškivati za čime ona čestna jer je bitno ako je tvoja duša zadovoljna onda će cijelo tvoje biće biti zdravo, sabrano i zbog toga djelatno, uvijek uspješno."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_24","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":24,"start_sec":152.8,"end_sec":158.72,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Ali ako je duša nezadovoljna onda gubiš smisao i sve u tebi podivlja."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_25","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":25,"start_sec":159.68,"end_sec":161.28,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Pogledaj, i osluškuju."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_26","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":26,"start_sec":163.52,"end_sec":165.12,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Jer mi svi osluškujemo svoje tijelo."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_27","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":27,"start_sec":165.28,"end_sec":169.12,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Ona kaže, i ovoj želji da skruli, znači da sam gladan."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_28","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":28,"start_sec":169.36,"end_sec":172.24,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"I ovoj glava me boli, znači nešto nije u redu, trebao bi tabletu."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_29","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":29,"start_sec":173.04,"end_sec":175.76,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"I ovoj, nervoza sam, a trebao bi sad uzeti crnu kavu."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_30","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":30,"start_sec":176.08,"end_sec":178.8,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Dakle, uvijek slušamo glasove tijela."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_31","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":31,"start_sec":179.28,"end_sec":183.52,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Da li kad slušaš glasove svoje duše, da si ikad čuo kako tvoja duša jeca?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_32","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":32,"start_sec":185.04,"end_sec":196.48,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Na večer si se najeo i opio tako dalje, ležeš u krevet, baš te briga, duša jeca, zar mi malo, baš ni jednu kost nećeš baciti da bar nešto pojedem?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_33","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":33,"start_sec":196.96,"end_sec":206.8,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Zar ćeš sa tim teretom svojih grižnja i tereta i briga i krivica zaista spavati a dok ja patim?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_34","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":34,"start_sec":209.44,"end_sec":217.36,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Zar ćeš zaista na meni ostaviti tu svoju psovku te svoje besramne ružne riječi, svoju mržnju?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_35","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":35,"start_sec":218.32,"end_sec":220,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Zašto me ubijaš, pita duša."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_36","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":36,"start_sec":223.2,"end_sec":225.2,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Ja sam tvoj život, kaže tvoja duša."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_37","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":37,"start_sec":226,"end_sec":227.68,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Ja sam tvoja duboka čežnja."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_38","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":38,"start_sec":227.68,"end_sec":228.88,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Ja sam tvoja budućnost."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_39","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":39,"start_sec":229.44,"end_sec":229.84,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Zašto me?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_40","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":40,"start_sec":230.24,"end_sec":231.52,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Zašto me ne njeguješ?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_41","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":41,"start_sec":231.68,"end_sec":232.56,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Zašto me ne voliš?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_42","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":42,"start_sec":234.56,"end_sec":237.68,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Duša moja, što da učinim za tebe do uskrsa?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_43","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":43,"start_sec":240.72,"end_sec":245.28,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Korisno je vrijeme posta, molitve i dobrih dijela."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_44","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":44,"start_sec":247.52,"end_sec":256.88,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Korisno je vrijeme tišine i mira da čujemo korijene svoje duše i da ih znamo zaliti i nahraniti i odrasti."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_45","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":45,"start_sec":257.92,"end_sec":258.8,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Što da ja učinim?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_46","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":46,"start_sec":259.6,"end_sec":261.2,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Da li sam uopće što god do sad učinio?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_47","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":47,"start_sec":261.68,"end_sec":264.72,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Da li sam i jedan petak nakon postijao da me zaboljelo?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_48","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":48,"start_sec":267.28,"end_sec":269.92,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Jesam li molio drugačije i više nego do sada?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_49","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":49,"start_sec":270.08,"end_sec":271.84,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Jesam li počeo čitati Sveto pismo?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_50","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":50,"start_sec":273.36,"end_sec":275.2,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Da li sam pronašao smisao svoga života?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_51","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":51,"start_sec":275.68,"end_sec":277.36,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Da li znam kuda moj život ide?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_52","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":52,"start_sec":278,"end_sec":278.8,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Zašto živim?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_53","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":53,"start_sec":280.16,"end_sec":281.52,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Što je u životu najvažnije?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_54","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":54,"start_sec":282.32,"end_sec":283.44,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Da li sam zavolio sebe?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_55","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":55,"start_sec":284.48,"end_sec":286,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Da li sam pronašao svoje zvanje?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_56","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":56,"start_sec":287.28,"end_sec":288.72,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Što me opterećuje najviše?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_57","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":57,"start_sec":289.44,"end_sec":291.6,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Jesam li već postao od toga psihički bolestan?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_58","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":58,"start_sec":291.84,"end_sec":292.08,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Zašto?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_59","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":59,"start_sec":292.64,"end_sec":300.88,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Da li znam šutjeti, meditirati, polako razmišljati, a ne vikati, vikati, govoriti, govoriti i tako još više rastresati svoju dušu?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_60","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":60,"start_sec":301.36,"end_sec":302.96,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Da li čitam koju dobru knjigu?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_61","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":61,"start_sec":303.36,"end_sec":307.92,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Da li volim uzeti nešto što me napalja, što me usrećuje, neka dobra knjiga."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_62","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":62,"start_sec":308.32,"end_sec":311.12,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Da li znam prekinuti televizijsku emisiju koja me ubija?"}
