{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_76","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":76,"start_sec":365.52,"end_sec":369.68,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Sjećam se danas kad sam išao s fakulteta i za mene su više dvije studentice."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_77","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":77,"start_sec":371.28,"end_sec":373.6,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Da sam rekao jedno, dugo te već nema."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_78","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":78,"start_sec":376.64,"end_sec":377.92,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Lijepo je što postojiš."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_79","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":79,"start_sec":378.72,"end_sec":380.88,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Ona se tako zacrvenila, zbilja."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_80","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":80,"start_sec":381.6,"end_sec":381.68,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"je."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_81","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":81,"start_sec":390,"end_sec":411.44,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Koliko sreće možete pružiti sa jednom dobrom riječju, a koliko ubojitih strela i otrova stavite u ljude kad ih nepravedno kritizirate, kad im ružno riječ kažete, prljavih vica ispričate, kad predima ugovarate nekoga, kad pisujete."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_82","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":82,"start_sec":416,"end_sec":419.12,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Duša moja, što mogu za tebe učiniti još do uskrsa."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_83","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":83,"start_sec":421.04,"end_sec":424.48,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Evo, prepuštam vas vašoj duši."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_84","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":84,"start_sec":425.04,"end_sec":428.16,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Tri minute vremena za jedno dobro pismo, pa onda mikrofon."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_85","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":85,"start_sec":429.76,"end_sec":432.24,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Čega da se odreknem do uskrsa?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_86","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":86,"start_sec":434.64,"end_sec":436.64,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"A čega da se odreknem za cijeli život?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_87","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":87,"start_sec":438.64,"end_sec":462.48,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Cigarete, droga, alkohol, hrpe tableta, ružne riječi, psovka, utoliko toga se možemo odreći."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_88","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":88,"start_sec":462.64,"end_sec":464.32,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"A makar jednoga se odreći još."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_89","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":89,"start_sec":465.92,"end_sec":466.72,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Do uskrsa."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_90","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":90,"start_sec":470.32,"end_sec":474.64,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Vidim da je vama domaća ili školska zadaća teška kada ovako sporo ide."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_91","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":91,"start_sec":476.72,"end_sec":478.32,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Dajem vam još minutu, dvije."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_92","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":92,"start_sec":480.08,"end_sec":481.76,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Neka duša govori, bit će to dobro."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_93","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":93,"start_sec":487.76,"end_sec":495.52,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Ima neko ko misli da bi njegov tekst poslužio drugima ili da nije pre intiman da bi se mogao pročitati."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_94","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":94,"start_sec":496.64,"end_sec":500.96,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Ti, ako kažeš možeš, ajde."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_95","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":95,"start_sec":504.4,"end_sec":509.68,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"A ne trezeš se od, pa Isus kaže ne boji se."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_96","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":96,"start_sec":509.92,"end_sec":511.52,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"A vidiš kad ti njega čuješ, fino."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_97","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":97,"start_sec":512.16,"end_sec":514.08,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_01","speaker":"Gost 1","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Hvani Nisi Marija, djecu Božja."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_98","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":98,"start_sec":514.48,"end_sec":518.24,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Da, a ti se zoveš, osim dijete Božje, Tomislav."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_99","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":99,"start_sec":524.8,"end_sec":530.24,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_01","speaker":"Gost 1","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Ovo ću pitanje malo lakše pročitati da ga možda neki bolje shvate."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_100","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":100,"start_sec":531.28,"end_sec":536.56,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_01","speaker":"Gost 1","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Dušo moja, dušo moja što želiš da učinim za tebe do uskrsa."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_101","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":101,"start_sec":539.04,"end_sec":564.16,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_01","speaker":"Gost 1","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Tomislavi, dovedi me do Isusa, samo to, dovedi me jer kad me dovedeš do Isusa, doveo si me do svega dobrog, doveo si me do izvora radosti, ljubavi, dobrote, mira, pravednosti, do izvora života za čim ja toliko teđem."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_102","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":102,"start_sec":567.04,"end_sec":569.68,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Tomislavi, jeli ti to krumicu nosiš oko vrata?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_103","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":103,"start_sec":570.16,"end_sec":570.24,"speaker_id":null,"speaker":null,"srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Da."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_104","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":104,"start_sec":570.88,"end_sec":572.24,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"I izvrstan čestitam ti."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_105","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":105,"start_sec":574.64,"end_sec":585.68,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Ti si jedinstven i tako rijedak od ljudi koji razumiju da se rat u Hrvatskoj tek sad najteže vodi i da je sada duhovni rat za čovjeka, protiv zla i ti to nosiš."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_106","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":106,"start_sec":586.48,"end_sec":588.96,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Da nas to više to stavi oko vrata, to mislite."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_107","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":107,"start_sec":589.52,"end_sec":592,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Recimo da to ponesemo tako, bez straha."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_108","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":108,"start_sec":593.04,"end_sec":596.72,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Vrijeme je krunice da i molite i da dovedeš dušu do Isusa."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_109","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":109,"start_sec":596.8,"end_sec":597.44,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Puno ti hvala."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_110","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":110,"start_sec":609.84,"end_sec":609.92,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_02","speaker":"Gost 2","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"ti."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_111","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":111,"start_sec":612.96,"end_sec":621.76,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_02","speaker":"Gost 2","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Sve što je u meni željelo pjevati, Isus, hvala ti."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_112","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":112,"start_sec":623.76,"end_sec":624.64,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Tko je sljedeći?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_113","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":113,"start_sec":626.64,"end_sec":626.8,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Još?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_114","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":114,"start_sec":630.16,"end_sec":633.52,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Pa nisi samo Tomislav i Hrabrij, ja ovdje, a Tomislav tamo."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_115","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":115,"start_sec":633.68,"end_sec":634.56,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Ima li još netko?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_116","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":116,"start_sec":639.76,"end_sec":646,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_03","speaker":"Tomislav","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Zrinka, duša moja, što želiš da učinim za tebe?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_117","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":117,"start_sec":646.72,"end_sec":647.36,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_03","speaker":"Tomislav","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Do uskrsa."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_118","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":118,"start_sec":649.44,"end_sec":654.32,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_03","speaker":"Tomislav","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Ne kriči, ne viči, miruj samo, nestani u meni."}
