{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_128","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":128,"start_sec":685.12,"end_sec":691.12,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_03","speaker":"Tomislav","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Vjeruj samo, vjeruj, vjeruj da možeš i sve ih ljubi."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_129","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":129,"start_sec":694.56,"end_sec":696.24,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"To je proročka riječ bila lijepa."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_130","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":130,"start_sec":700.08,"end_sec":702.16,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_01","speaker":"Gost 1","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Što želiš da za tebe učinim dostojno?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_131","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":131,"start_sec":704,"end_sec":705.52,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"A ti si Ana Marija."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_132","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":132,"start_sec":706.48,"end_sec":708.48,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Tako lijepo ime imaš, lijepo da to čujem."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_133","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":133,"start_sec":708.64,"end_sec":709.04,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Hvala ti."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_134","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":134,"start_sec":710.72,"end_sec":720.24,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_01","speaker":"Gost 1","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Želim da me oživiš, želim da me zavoliš, želim da sebe zavoliš, želim da prihvatiš sebe, da sebe primijetiš."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_135","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":135,"start_sec":721.28,"end_sec":726,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_01","speaker":"Gost 1","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Zašto ne vidiš svoju vrijednost?, zašto se bojiš dati sve od sebe?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_136","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":136,"start_sec":727.36,"end_sec":729.04,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_01","speaker":"Gost 1","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Zašto ne možeš dati sve od sebe?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_137","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":137,"start_sec":730.32,"end_sec":731.28,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_01","speaker":"Gost 1","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Zašto te je strah?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_138","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":138,"start_sec":731.76,"end_sec":732.64,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_01","speaker":"Gost 1","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Čega se bojiš?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_139","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":139,"start_sec":733.2,"end_sec":738.96,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_03","speaker":"Tomislav","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Ana Marija, ti si dijete Bože, ti si dio Božanske obitelji, zašto se onda bojiš?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_140","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":140,"start_sec":744.48,"end_sec":760.24,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_02","speaker":"Gost 2","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"I su se hvala ti više."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_141","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":141,"start_sec":769.84,"end_sec":770.88,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Nema darivatelja."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_142","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":142,"start_sec":773.36,"end_sec":774.16,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Dobro, pomalo."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_143","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":143,"start_sec":774.4,"end_sec":774.88,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Ja sam nada."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_144","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":144,"start_sec":778.08,"end_sec":787.36,"speaker_id":null,"speaker":null,"srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Ja sam napisala u par stihova nešto eto što sam sad osjetila i kroz molitu i što moja duša skupa sada proživljava."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_145","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":145,"start_sec":789.76,"end_sec":801.28,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_03","speaker":"Tomislav","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Duša moja, ti više ne jecaš, ti miruješ tiho u prelijepoj ruci, Isus se drži na glavi svome, tome kao bijela lađa na sidru u luci."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_146","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":146,"start_sec":802.32,"end_sec":807.2,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_03","speaker":"Tomislav","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Ti i ja ljubimo se nježno, a naša ljubav, naš je dragi Bog."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_147","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":147,"start_sec":808.24,"end_sec":812.96,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_03","speaker":"Tomislav","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"O kako te zavolih dušo, ti središte mog bića, života mog."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_148","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":148,"start_sec":814.08,"end_sec":818.4,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_03","speaker":"Tomislav","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"U tebi živi Isus dragi, a što može usrećit nas više?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_149","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":149,"start_sec":819.04,"end_sec":821.68,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_03","speaker":"Tomislav","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Miru i dušo moja, topi se u sreći."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_150","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":150,"start_sec":822.8,"end_sec":825.68,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_03","speaker":"Tomislav","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Nek je Isus s nama, budi tiha, tiše."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_151","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":151,"start_sec":829.2,"end_sec":832.24,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Luka, hoćeš napraviti od ovoga melodiju?"}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_152","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":152,"start_sec":834.48,"end_sec":835.04,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Slaže se."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_153","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":153,"start_sec":835.28,"end_sec":836.56,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Da, izvolite."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_154","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":154,"start_sec":845.6,"end_sec":848.64,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Moja duša kaže: Valentina."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_155","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":155,"start_sec":852.48,"end_sec":854.8,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Želim da mi daš više tišina i mira."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_156","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":156,"start_sec":855.68,"end_sec":861.04,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Želim da mi dopustiš da se razlijem u tvome biću i da živim u tebi i da ti živiš po meni."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_157","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":157,"start_sec":862.08,"end_sec":866.48,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_00","speaker":"Tomislav Ivančić","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Želim da me hraniš da malo gledajući kroz moje oči vidjet ćeš bolje."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_158","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":158,"start_sec":867.6,"end_sec":874.56,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_03","speaker":"Tomislav","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Želim da ti želiš vidjeti koju ljepotu Bog ulije u tebe po meni i u meni."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_159","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":159,"start_sec":874.88,"end_sec":879.28,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_03","speaker":"Tomislav","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"živiš, sve biseri."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_160","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":160,"start_sec":880.32,"end_sec":889.28,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_02","speaker":"Gost 2","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"I su se volili, više od svega drugog volim te."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_161","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":161,"start_sec":892.32,"end_sec":909.04,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_02","speaker":"Gost 2","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Sve što je u meni želi pjevati, i su se volili."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_162","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":162,"start_sec":911.04,"end_sec":915.12,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_02","speaker":"Gost 2","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Htio bih te voljeti."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_163","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":163,"start_sec":915.92,"end_sec":920.72,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_02","speaker":"Gost 2","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Htio bih, duša moja, da moje vrijeme bude ispunjeno kvalitetnim sadržajima."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_164","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":164,"start_sec":921.36,"end_sec":925.52,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_02","speaker":"Gost 2","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Htio bih se hrabro soočiti sa svakim problemom i strahom."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_165","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":165,"start_sec":926.08,"end_sec":935.12,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_02","speaker":"Gost 2","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Htio bih, duša moja, da svaka moja riječ i pjesma bude ispunjena ljubavlju koja liječi druge duše u svakom ponovnom susretu."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_166","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":166,"start_sec":935.84,"end_sec":945.52,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_02","speaker":"Gost 2","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Htio bih, duša moja, prepoznati srodnu dušu da zajedno možemo hvaliti i slaviti Boga Oca i Sina i Duha Svetoga."}
{"id":"xhV7eRo8fvA_167","youtube_id":"xhV7eRo8fvA","channel":"duhovnost_hagio","upload_date":"2022-06-01","seq":167,"start_sec":945.92,"end_sec":946.16,"speaker_id":"SPEAKER_02","speaker":"Gost 2","srt_source":"sortformer","text":"Amen."}
